\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 This is a much stronger basis for the Traverse confrontation. Chanta's party doesn't need the Project Kebab personnel to create an opening in the security. They have the means to take the station outright. The problem becomes how that happens, how much damage they cause, and whether Chanta remains in control of his own rescue mission.\
The sequence has several particularly effective turns.\
The cigarette demonstration establishes the Joneses' lethal precision without killing anybody. The guard's \'93Missed me\'94 gives the Jones the chance to make the threat considerably more frightening. Ending with \'93You will stop smoking. It's bad for you\'94 is especially good: the Jones is simultaneously terrifying, officious and concerned about the guard's welfare.\
Then the Elvi's singing produces an entirely different result from what anybody expects. The armed confrontation collapses into genuine emotional distress. The guards console the Joneses voluntarily. That is the comic reversal I would protect. Their compassion, rather than their incompetence, makes them vulnerable.\
The Joneses' immediate recovery when the Elvi stop singing supplies the next reversal. They resume being lethally efficient, while the Elvi deal with the remaining opposition using discs.\
The established pink-tie Jones's response to gospel music provides precedent for emotional disintegration, although the collective response you propose is a new development. It needs no technical explanation in the scene.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs36 The transport check\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0 I checked the current \'93Sublime Point / Ruined Castle \'97 Location Bible\'94 against the older Geographic Research material.\
The Location Bible establishes two connections:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The station's passenger maglev to the Ruined Castle internal station.\uc0\u8232 \u8232 \
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The station/service level's secure service route into the Ruined Castle logistics and maintenance infrastructure, with a separate concealed vehicle entrance at Sublime Point.\uc0\u8232 \u8232 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The Bible doesn't explicitly specify the entire service route as a truck road running beside the maglev. The older research document describes a parallel freight railway, not a truck road, and contains other superseded design details.\
Your present specification \'97 a truck-capable service road alongside the Traverse \'97 resolves that distinction. I would incorporate it into the controlling geography rather than allow the older freight-railway design to creep back.\
It also means the destruction of the passenger transport needn't prevent Chanta's party proceeding. They can damage the cars and maglev without destroying the service road.\
There is a narrative reason for destroying the maglev as well: preventing immediate pursuit by passenger transport. That is a possible interpretation of the Elvi's plan, not yet an established motive.\
Chanta complaining after the Elvi carry out an agreed plan is another useful character beat. It could show him discovering that agreeing to something in principle and seeing Elvi execute it are rather different experiences.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs36 Three details still requiring control\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0 The civilians. The handful of Project Kebab personnel should have cleared the immediate confrontation area before the discs are used. We don't need to manufacture a crowd for the Joneses to endanger. Nor should we declare the entire station deserted without establishing that.\
The timing. The earlier timeline allocated roughly five minutes between Chanta being awakened and the Traverse crossing commencing. Your nineteen beats include a confrontation, a precision demonstration, a musical interruption, physical combat, binding prisoners, sabotaging the transport and transferring to trucks. The event timings will need revisiting. I won't compress this material artificially to preserve earlier estimates.\
The seismic egress. The disc activity offers a plausible causal connection to the Ruined Castle seismic egress being released. But that relationship, including the transmission of the disturbance and the egress mechanism, still needs establishing. Damage to the maglev and damage sufficient to trigger seismic protection elsewhere are not automatically equivalent.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs36 What this resolves\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0 The assault itself is now coherent. The Joneses have overwhelming psychological and tactical leverage even without numerical superiority. The guards behave credibly: they refuse to invite a gunfight, mistakenly believe they're safe, and finally fall victim to an unplanned act of kindness.\
The Elvi provide both the surprise and the destructive force. Chanta has sufficient reason to be alarmed by their behaviour without becoming an implausibly competent military commander.\
What remains unresolved is the decision to launch the assault at that particular moment. The Project Kebab movement still needs to mean something, unless we replace that trigger. Likewise, Chanta's inactivity since speaking with Sarah still needs a character-consistent explanation.\
One further continuity detail: the Elvisettes arrived with Chanta, the Elvi and the Joneses. Their role or whereabouts during this confrontation remain to be placed; they must not disappear through omission.\
Finally, the cigarette cartel run by vicious primary-school teachers belongs to the world as you've specified it. The Jones's health warning works without stopping the confrontation to explain the cartel. The underlying satire can do its work elsewhere.\
I would preserve your confrontation sequence substantially intact. The outstanding work is to connect it to Chanta's preceding decisions and the Ruined Castle consequences, not to redesign the confrontation itself.\
}